Layouts having .layout.three-column have horizontal resizing affordances in the gutters between panes 0 and 1, and between pages 1 and 2. \
The affordances are hidden by default and toggled on and off by clicking in the gutter. \
Moving the affordance adds space to one pane and subtracts from the other. \
The affordance between panes 0 and 1 can be moved up to 15% to the right and back from its initial position.\
